PLANNING.md — Exam View Portal
Single source of truth for all decisions. Read this fully before writing any code. Do not change, contradict, or "improve" decisions here without asking the owner first.

1. What is Exam View
Exam View is a web portal (exam portal) with user management, roles/permissions, announcements, push notifications, global search, maps, WhatsApp/email integration, offline support and a customizable dashboard. Core exam features will be added after the platform foundation is complete.
Concurrent users: minimum 5, maximum 1000 working at the same time for a few hours.
Deployment: client and server are deployed separately initially. They may be deployed together later if needed.
Hosting: run locally first. Shift to AWS after the project runs successfully (see FUTURE.md).
