9. Feature Specifications
9.1 Authentication & Security
Login: email/phone + password, Google login, Microsoft login.
Forgot password flow.
Tokens: access token (in memory) + refresh token (httpOnly cookie). Do not store tokens in IndexedDB.
2FA: Google/Microsoft/other authenticator (TOTP), OTP login. Admin can disable a user's 2FA.
Do not log out if the API is offline or not responding. Force logout only when refresh explicitly returns 401/403.
Rate limiting, validation, CORS configured for separate client/server origins.
9.2 User Management
Create, delete, update, view, 2FA disable, role, access/permission, status (active / inactive / suspended), user timezone, sort/modify by last activity.
9.3 App Groups & Permission System
App groups with group-level permissions; roles; per-user access. Frontend usePermission hook and <Can/> component; backend permission middleware.
9.4 Announcements (admin)
Fields: title, content, action URL, priority, display line, start, expiry, preview, status.
9.5 Push Notifications
Fields: title, body, action URL, recipients (all users / admin / specific users). Auto-delete after read. Delivered live through WebSocket.
9.6 Global Search
Command-palette style search across modules.
9.7 Legal & Instructions
Terms & Conditions, Privacy Policy, Instruction page.
9.8 Integrations
Email: Google, SMTP and Outlook providers (swappable via interface).
WhatsApp: wa.officall.ceoitbox.com.
Google Maps: place lookup, distance between two places, points shown on map view.
Cloudinary: see section 10.
9.9 Dashboard
Widget-based, customizable (widget registry + grid layout).
9.10 Landing Page & Route Guards
Landing page, PrivateRoute, PublicRoute, PermissionRoute.
9.11 Layout, Theme, UI Feedback
Layout system (sidebar/header), dark mode and light mode.
boneyard skeletons for component data loading.
Toast pop-up notifications at the upper-right corner.
Application loading screen.
